+        // `get.run()`, `set + 1` — is a plain identifier statement, not an
+        // accessor, so the `;` must stay a statement separator. A paren'ed
+        // accessor must be followed by a body (`= expr`/`{...}`/`: type`)
+        // or it is a call, not an accessor.
